  - [ ] Poseidon nullifier derivation: `Poseidon(aadhaarHash, app_id, walletSecret)`
  - [ ] Mandatory claims: nationality=IN, age≥18, kycStatus=VERIFIED
  - [ ] Optional field commitments (state, gender, age)
  - [ ] SMT inclusion/exclusion proof verification in-circuit
- [ ] Run AlgoPlonk to generate PuyaPy LogicSig verifier from circuit
- [ ] Compile verifier TEAL via AlgoKit/PuyaPy
- [ ] Unit test circuit with mock Aadhaar XML inputs (Go tests)

